---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { privacyContactMailto, submissionEmailAddress } from '../../lib/site';

const lastUpdated = 'October 13, 2026';
const privacyMailto = privacyContactMailto();
const contactEmail = submissionEmailAddress();
---

<Layout
	title="Privacy Policy | Vibe Parenting"
	description="How Vibe Parenting handles analytics, optional cookies, project submissions, and links to third-party learning projects."
	ogTitle="Privacy Policy | Vibe Parenting"
	ogDescription="How Vibe Parenting handles analytics, optional cookies, project submissions, and links to third-party learning projects."
>
	<section class="border-b border-border bg-gradient-to-b from-accent-soft/50 to-canvas">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
			<h1 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-5xl sm:leading-tight">
				Privacy Policy
			</h1>
			<p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted">
				We try to keep this straightforward. This page describes what the Vibe Parenting website
				actually does today—not what we might add later.
			</p>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted/90">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10 sm:px-6 sm:py-12 lg:px-8 lg:py-16">
		<article class="prose-editorial mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-10 text-base">
			<section aria-labelledby="info-we-collect">
				<h2 id="info-we-collect" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
					Information we collect
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Google Analytics (optional).</strong> If you accept
						in our consent banner or Privacy Settings, Google Analytics 4 (GA4) loads and may collect
						technical and usage information—such as pages viewed, approximate location derived from IP
						address, browser type, device type, and referral source. We do not send names, email
						addresses, or information about children to GA4 through this website’s integration.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Cloudflare Web Analytics (separate).</strong>
						Cloudflare Web Analytics may collect privacy-oriented traffic metrics when you visit the
						live site. It is enabled in our Cloudflare dashboard and is
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">not</strong> controlled by your Google Analytics
						preference. Declining Google Analytics does not turn off Cloudflare Web Analytics. See
						<a
							href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/"
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Cloudflare’s privacy policy
						</a>.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Stored in your browser.</strong> We save your analytics
						choice (accept or decline) in your browser’s local storage so we can remember it on future
						visits. We do not use that storage for advertising profiles.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Voluntary submissions.</strong> There is no newsletter
						sign-up and no contact form on this site. If you choose to submit a project, you use a
						<code class="rounded bg-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm text-ink">mailto:</code> link that opens
						your email app. Any information you send (project details, your name, email address, and so
						on) is whatever you choose to include in that message. We do not receive it unless you send
						the email.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Accounts.</strong> Vibe Parenting does not offer user
						accounts or log-in on this website.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="how-we-use">
				<h2 id="how-we-use" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
					How we use information
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>When Google Analytics is enabled, we use it to understand, in aggregate:</p>
					<ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
						<li>How visitors discover Vibe Parenting</li>
						<li>Which projects and pages people find useful</li>
						<li>How people move through the project directory</li>
						<li>How we might improve the site over time</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						Email submissions are used to review projects for possible inclusion in the directory and
						to reply when appropriate.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="analytics-services">
				<h2 id="analytics-services" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
					Analytics services
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Google Analytics 4</strong> (measurement ID
						<code class="rounded bg-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm text-ink">G-YGH3N5GGPF</code>) loads
						only after you accept optional analytics. Google may process data according to its own
						policies. Learn more in
						<a
							href="https://policies.google.com/privacy"
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Google’s Privacy Policy
						</a>
						and
						<a
							href="https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/6004245"
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							How Google Analytics collects and processes data
						</a>.
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> is enabled for
						our Cloudflare Pages deployment. It is separate from GA4 and may collect technical
						visit data even if you decline GA4. See
						<a
							href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/analytics/web-analytics/"
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
						>
							Cloudflare Web Analytics documentation
						</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="cookies-tracking">
				<h2 id="cookies-tracking" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
					Cookies and tracking
				</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>
						If you accept optional analytics, GA4 may set cookies or use similar technologies (for
						example, identifiers whose names often start with
						<code class="rounded bg-canvas px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm text-ink">_ga</code>) to distinguish
						browsers and measure traffic.
					</p>
					<p>
						You can change your Google Analytics choice anytime via
						<button
							type="button"
							data-open-privacy-settings
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
						>
							Privacy Settings
						</button>
						in the footer. Declining or withdrawing stops future GA4 on this browser and clears
						GA-related cookies where we can. It does not turn off Cloudflare Web Analytics and does
						not delete data Google may have already received from earlier visits.
					</p>
					<p>
						Your browser may also let you block cookies or local storage. Blocking local storage may
						prevent us from remembering your analytics choice.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="children">
				<h2 id="children" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Children’s privacy</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>
						Vibe Parenting is written for parents, educators, and adult creators exploring tools for
						children. The site is not designed for children to create accounts or submit personal
						information directly on vibeparenting.org.
					</p>
					<p>
						We do not intentionally collect personal information directly from children through this
						website. Like most websites, analytics services may still receive technical data from any
						browser that loads the site, including if a child uses a shared device. We do not ask
						visitors to enter a child’s name or other identifying details into our analytics tools.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="third-party">
				<h2 id="third-party" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">
					Third-party projects
				</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">
					Listed projects are run by their creators, not by Vibe Parenting. When you follow a link to
					an external project, that site’s privacy practices apply. We encourage you to read their
					policies before sharing personal information there.
				</p>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="contact">
				<h2 id="contact" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Contact</h2>
				<div class="mt-4 space-y-4">
					<p>
						Questions about this policy or your privacy on vibeparenting.org? Email us at
						<a
							href={privacyMailto}
							class="font-medium text-accent underline-offset-2 hover:underline"
						>
							{contactEmail}
						</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<section aria-labelledby="updates">
				<h2 id="updates" class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Updates</h2>
				<p class="mt-4">
					We may update this page when the website changes. When we do, we will revise the “Last
					updated” date above.
				</p>
			</section>
		</article>
	</section>
</Layout>
